1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,540
A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body.

2
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:16,640
You've already done everything you need to do here.

3
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,280
There's no reason for you to stay.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,500
Medusa wants you to join her now to help with some other tasks she has in mind for you.

5
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,280
But I don't want to leave.

6
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,040
I want to stay right here.

7
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,740
Personally, I don't care one way or the other.

8
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,480
I just pass along information.

9
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,400
But I can't say that Medusa will feel the same way.

10
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,600
This is the first time I've ever had friends.

11
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:40,760
If I leave, I won't be able to see them anymore.

12
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,080
Your whining is giving me a headache.

13
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:48,280
Just do what Medusa tells you to, idiot.

14
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,300
Sooner or later, everyone here will find out what you did.

15
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:57,340
Or have you already forgotten the snake you planted in Marie to accelerate the pace of Stein's madness?

16
00:00:57,340 --> 00:01:01,480
When they know about that, there's no way you're going to get off with a reaper chopper, too.

17
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,960
If you know that won't be it.

18
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:06,180
Just think how Maka will feel.

19
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:07,640
She'll probably cry.

20
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,080
Don't you see it's over?

21
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:14,980
Nothing you can do now will change the fact that you betrayed them all.

22
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:34,040
I'm falling down to my shadow.

23
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:57,880
See you in your dreams, yeah, baby.

24
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:12,440
Why do you do this?

25
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:20,680
I difficult to find any potential.

26
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:24,880
When you've lost, 13 years

27
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:28,240
Forever with your soul

28
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:32,160
見上げれば輝く

29
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,540
月のように

30
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:57,480
Wake up get out here

31
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:04,860
We came a long way to get here at least you can do is invite us in and offer us a drink. Are you finished?

32
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:12,600
That's the Keishin in there you can yell and complain all you want it won't bother him more than a buzzing fly

33
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:15,600
Well, maybe he'd rather hear the screaming of a mosquito

34
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,160
Looking for a fight old man

35
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:27,340
Lady Arachne please wait let us go in first

36
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,340
You can stay out there I'll handle this alone

37
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:48,520
Lady Arachne

38
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:56,140
Krona's escape show me your smile, please

39
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:12,020
Greetings Keishin Asherah I am Lady Arachne

40
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:17,700
I know your great power and respect it. I have journeyed far to meet you

41
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,940
Will you not show me your face?

42
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,960
I've heard others say you hide here because you're timid

43
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:31,140
But I suspect you came to this isolated mountain to rejuvenate your soul am I correct?

44
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:34,460
Perhaps I'm wrong

45
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:36,740
Perhaps you're as afraid of the Grim Reaper as they say

46
00:04:36,740 --> 00:04:44,960
I grow weary of hide-and-seek. Please come out

47
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,040
Go away

48
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:56,440
Are you this intimidated by a lone woman that's almost cute

49
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:14,040
I found you?

50
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:18,040
I've been looking forward to this moment

51
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:22,040
What are you planning? What is it you want with me woman?

52
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,920
The Reaper has stood in my way long enough

53
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:28,300
I want you to help me eliminate him

54
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:34,220
I've hated him for 800 years

55
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:36,020
I loathe him more now than ever

56
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:38,720
You understand how that feels? I know you do

57
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:49,020
If we don't join forces, we'll both fall to him again

58
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:51,020
Is that what you want?

59
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:54,020
To be tied up in a sack of your own skin again?

60
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:56,020
Fight with me

61
00:05:56,020 --> 00:05:59,020
Together we'll be so strong nothing can hurt us

62
00:05:59,020 --> 00:06:01,020
We'll protect each other

63
00:06:01,020 --> 00:06:16,320
I'll give it all to you

64
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:18,320
Don't you see what I'm offering?

65
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:21,320
My heart, my soul

66
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:24,320
All of it is yours to claim

67
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:30,320
Yummy!

68
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,320
Hey, Krona

69
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:34,320
You should practice with us the next time we work on Resonance Link

70
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:37,320
It's fun, and I know you'd add a lot of strength to our team

71
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,320
Oh, uh, yeah

72
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:41,320
And I'll be there, so you'll be trained by the best of the best

73
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:43,320
You can't beat that!

74
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,320
Have another sandwich, Krona

75
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,320
There's plenty

76
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,320
Thanks

77
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:50,320
You may be ugly, but your food is delicious

78
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:53,320
Actually, I can't take credit for this

79
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,320
This time

80
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,320
It was a special treat from Miss Marie

81
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:01,320
I'm sure taking care of Professor Stein is pretty hard on her

82
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:04,320
But somehow she still makes time to take care of us

83
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:07,320
You're gonna kill whoever did this to the Professor

84
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:10,320
Of course, I'll have to eat first to build up my strength

85
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:13,320
Hey, why don't we go visit the Professor?

86
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,320
I'm sure he'd love to see you

87
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:17,320
What do you say, Krona? Do you want to come along?

88
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:20,320
I... I... I have to use the restroom

89
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,320
Huh?

90
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:23,320
You could do that by yourself

91
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,320
I'm staying here

92
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:26,320
Hey, there's still food to eat

93
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:28,320
Where are you going?

94
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,320
I want to stay with the food

95
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,320
That's weird even for him

96
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,320
Hmm

97
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:47,320
It's impossible

98
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:49,320
How could I ever tell them what I did?

99
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:53,320
Ragnarok was right, I can't stay

100
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:55,320
I don't belong here anymore

101
00:07:55,320 --> 00:08:00,320
You're such an obedient child, Krona

102
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:04,320
You finally see the truth, don't you?

103
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,320
You don't fit in here, not really

104
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:09,320
The only place you'll ever belong is with me

105
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,320
Lady Medusa

106
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:24,320
You should be more careful

107
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:27,320
This belongs in a frame, not on the ground

108
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,320
Oh, yeah

109
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:34,320
Uh, Maka

110
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,320
Hmm?

111
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,320
Do, um...

112
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,320
Do you think I could ask you something?

113
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,320
Of course

114
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,320
Ask me anything

115
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,320
I, uh...

116
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,320
I was wondering about your mother

117
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,320
Oh, it's complicated

118
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,320
She's sort of missing right now

119
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,320
Wait, hold on

120
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,320
What do you mean missing?

121
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:53,320
Well, occasionally she'll send me a postcard

122
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,320
So I know she's off somewhere

123
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,320
Traveling around the world

124
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,320
But I don't really know where she is

125
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,320
Or what she's doing

126
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:02,320
She abandoned her daughter to go on some trip?

127
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,320
Who would do something like that?

128
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,320
So what...

129
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,320
What kind of person is she?

130
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,320
She's like a grizzly bear

131
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,320
A grizzly bear?

132
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,320
She's strong, hot-tempered

133
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,320
You don't want to see her when she's angry

134
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:19,320
But she's still warm and kind-hearted and loyal

135
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:22,320
That seems like a lot of things for one person to be

136
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,320
So, um...

137
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,320
Tell me some more

138
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:28,320
What's the best memory you have from when you were younger...

139
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,320
Of her?

140
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,320
That's easy

141
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,320
Definitely the divorce

142
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,320
Huh?

143
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:35,320
She was so cool and collected

144
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,320
It was pretty amazing

145
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,320
What a weird answer

146
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:40,320
Maka's got a strange family life

147
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,320
What's wrong?

148
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,320
Did I say something odd?

149
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,320
Huh?

150
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,320
Oh, no

151
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,320
No!

152
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,320
I know that...

153
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:51,320
I know she's not around now

154
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,320
But how do you feel about her?

155
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,320
She's my mom, silly

156
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,320
I love her

157
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,320
Huh?

158
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:04,320
Didn't you say you had to use the restroom?

159
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,320
Yeah

160
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:12,320
I'll need 500 tons of concrete and 200 tons of I-beams

161
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:16,320
Also, 30,000 bearings with a 500 millimeter diameter

162
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,320
You think you can make that happen?

163
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,320
Why do you need all that?

164
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,320
Are you planning to build a skyscraper?

165
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:26,320
Whether it's fixing leaky pipes or constructing a building

166
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:29,320
If Lord Death asks me to do something, I'll do it

167
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:32,320
How obedient of you

168
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,320
Hm?

169
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:36,320
Hey, I forgot to tell you something

170
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:41,320
If you see Uncle Bob from the coffee shop, I need you to let me know

171
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:45,320
It's very important, I can't dance without my rumba coffee

172
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:48,320
I forgot to tell you something, too

173
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:52,320
You should get some new shoes, sandals aren't safe for construction

174
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,320
Hmm

175
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:59,320
Does he have no respect for a man's personal taste in footwear?

176
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,320
Joe Buditake

177
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,320
He's a hard man to grasp

178
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:07,320
Like the steam rising from his coffee cup

179
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:10,320
I find him unsettling

180
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:12,320
He reminds me too much of my father

181
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,320
Unwilling to reveal his secrets

182
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,320
Always hiding behind a mask

183
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:20,320
Not telling anyone what his true intentions are

184
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:34,320
There, that's much better

185
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,320
What the hell is going on down here?

186
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,320
This is unacceptable

187
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:54,320
Who can perpetrate such a horror?

188
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:56,320
And there he goes, we've lost him again

189
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,320
Hey, wait!

190
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,320
Where did he go?

191
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,320
Let it panic!

192
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:11,320
This kid is becoming troublesome

193
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,320
Why is he so persistent?

194
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:17,320
He should just relax with a good cup of coffee

195
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:19,320
It was like this when I got here

196
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,320
Empty

197
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,320
No belongings

198
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,320
No crona

199
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,320
He probably ran away

200
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,320
Why would he do that?

201
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,320
He's been acting strange lately

202
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:39,320
Don't tell me you haven't noticed

203
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:41,320
Distant, scared all the time

204
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:45,320
It almost seemed like he didn't want to hang around with us anymore

205
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,320
Admit it

206
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,320
You sensed it too

207
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:55,320
At any rate, Lord Death will find out he's gone sooner or later

208
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,320
And he won't be pleased

209
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,320
I'll find him

210
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,320
Hey, Mokka?

211
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:03,320
Just like her

212
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:06,320
Running off after him without a thought in her head

213
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:23,320
Rona, why?

214
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,320
Why'd you go?

215
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:26,320
Where are you?

216
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:35,320
Why now?

217
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:37,320
I don't understand

218
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:42,320
Everyone thinks you ran away, but they're wrong

219
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,320
Aren't they?

220
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:58,320
I don't know why you're so bummed

221
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,320
Just think

222
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,320
We never have to look at their ugly faces again

223
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,320
Give it a little while

224
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,320
Once you get home

225
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,320
You'll forget all about the stupid academy

226
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,320
I don't think so

227
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:09,320
I'm not going back to Medusa

228
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,320
Huh?

229
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,320
I can't stay at the academy

230
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,320
And I can't go home

231
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:14,320
I just want to be alone

232
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,320
A weakling like you

233
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:17,320
You won't last two days on your own

234
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,320
What are you gonna do for food?

235
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,320
If you're not going to Medusa's

236
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:22,320
You might as well turn around and go back to the academy

237
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,320
Get off of me!

238
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,320
Get off of me!

239
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:27,320
There's no way I can go back there!

240
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,320
Stupid kid

241
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,320
What are you doing trying to starve me?

242
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,320
I couldn't stand them being so nice to me after I betrayed them

243
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,320
It was breaking my heart

244
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:35,320
You don't know anything you useless panty!

245
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,320
Stop it!

246
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,320
That hurts!

247
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,320
Get off of me!

248
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,320
Get off of me!

249
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,320
Get off of me!

250
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,320
Get off of me!

251
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,320
Please forgive me Lady Aragne

252
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,320
You must be in so much pain

253
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:56,320
That should never have happened while I was with you

254
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,320
It's all my fault

255
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,320
Please

256
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,320
Please forgive me

257
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:03,320
We succeeded in recruiting the Kishin to our side

258
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:07,320
This is a time to celebrate, not to cry

259
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,320
Yes

260
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,320
My lady

261
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:12,620
Well, it wasn't easy, but I did it.

262
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:16,220
Our new Kishan friend's been given the best bedroom we had available.

263
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:18,340
He even had a little snack on the way.

264
00:15:18,580 --> 00:15:19,460
Three of our men.

265
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:24,060
He's like a dog being introduced to its new owner for the first time.

266
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,580
He'll be suspicious of us at first.

267
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:29,360
Tasty.

268
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:35,080
How long are we gonna stay in this hole?

269
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:36,800
I'm baking in the sun!

270
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:40,260
I found a place where I can be alone like I wanted.

271
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,940
I'll stay here until I'm ready to leave.

272
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:46,140
Oh, so hot. I can't take it.

273
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:48,560
My insides are starting to boil!

274
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:54,980
I've been somewhere like this before.

275
00:15:55,740 --> 00:15:57,380
A lonely place without water.

276
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,200
That's where we met.

277
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,880
My first lonely place in the desert.

278
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:05,360
Will you let me be your friend, Krona?

279
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:11,340
It was like feeling sunlight for the first time.

280
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:14,520
But we were as different as night and day.

281
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:18,560
How could I ever let myself imagine our friendship would last?

282
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:22,100
It was a nice dream, I guess.

283
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,700
But it would be better if I could forget it.

284
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:27,160
Krona!

285
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:30,520
Krona!

286
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:33,380
You're sure this is the right spot?

287
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:34,200
Yeah.

288
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:36,520
I'm positive I can feel a soul nearby.

289
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:38,800
Krona!

290
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:42,080
Maka.

291
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:44,680
Stop here, soul.

292
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,260
Krona!

293
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:50,260
Krona!

294
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:52,840
I finally found you and let's get you out of there.

295
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:53,680
Hey, soul!

296
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:54,480
Give me a hand!

297
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,100
Why did you come after me?

298
00:16:58,060 --> 00:16:59,400
You can leave me alone.

299
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,900
I didn't ask for your help.

300
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:03,200
Go away.

301
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:05,900
I said go away!

302
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:09,360
Why, Krona?

303
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,160
I don't want you here.

304
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,300
You don't understand anything about me.

305
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:15,360
Go!

306
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:16,840
Just get out of here!

307
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:20,840
I can't look at you.

308
00:17:21,320 --> 00:17:23,260
Not after what I did.

309
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:27,080
The things that have been happening to Professor Stein.

310
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:29,300
Those are all because of me.

311
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,460
It was in Miss Marie's drink.

312
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:35,360
I put one of Lady Medusa's special little snakes in it.

313
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:39,600
Miss Marie never even suspected me for a second.

314
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:41,400
She liked me.

315
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:44,540
She kept telling me what a good kid I was.

316
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,500
Why'd she do that?

317
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:47,240
I never asked her to be nice to me.

318
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,080
Having faith in other people?

319
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:50,960
Trusting someone not to hurt you?

320
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,680
How idiotic is that?

321
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,240
You know?

322
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,280
Stop.

323
00:17:57,420 --> 00:17:58,360
Don't move.

324
00:17:58,560 --> 00:17:59,460
Not another word.

325
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:00,100
Maka.

326
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:01,200
Hey!

327
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:12,680
Don't you dare say one more negative thing about yourself.

328
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,700
You think of yourself as someone who's cowardly and weak.

329
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:22,940
Yet whenever something happens, you put everyone else first.

330
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:26,680
And then...

331
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:28,380
You end up getting hurt.

332
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:30,920
Please stop this.

333
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:33,300
You're hurting my friend and I can't take it.

334
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:39,320
It was Medusa who made you do it.

335
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:40,940
You didn't want to, did you?

336
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:41,820
Well?

337
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,220
Please tell me I'm right.

338
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:44,840
No.

339
00:18:44,840 --> 00:18:51,600
I can't say it.

340
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:55,440
Don't, don't you see?

341
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:57,240
She's my mother.

342
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:00,020
I hate this so much.

343
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,980
But there's nothing I can do.

344
00:19:02,540 --> 00:19:04,420
I'm so tired of all this.

345
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:08,640
When can I stop hurting people.

346
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:11,600
I don't want to hurt anybody.

347
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:13,900
I don't want to make people sad.

348
00:19:13,900 --> 00:19:17,520
I don't want to lose my only friend.

349
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:17,540
I don't want to lose my only friend.

350
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:21,960
You see?

351
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:24,360
I am a coward, like I said.

352
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:28,920
And, and I might end up betraying you again.

353
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:31,000
I won't let that happen.

354
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:33,240
I promise I won't.

355
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:36,960
What do you say?

356
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:39,140
Can we go home?

357
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:51,020
Have they realized they're in a big hole yet?

358
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:54,920
I suppose they're expecting me to dig them out of there.

359
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:57,380
Not cool.

360
00:19:58,300 --> 00:19:59,920
Not even a little bit cool.

361
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:06,880
I understand your loyalty to your friend.

362
00:20:06,880 --> 00:20:09,420
But Krona did sign the Academy Agreement.

363
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:12,440
Students who break the rules are expelled.

364
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,740
That's the way it works.

365
00:20:14,220 --> 00:20:15,600
Making an exception for him

366
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:17,920
would undermine the stability of the entire Academy.

367
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:18,940
It can't be done.

368
00:20:19,520 --> 00:20:20,920
Krona knows he was wrong.

369
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:23,300
He already apologized for what he did.

370
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:25,000
He feels awful about all of it.

371
00:20:25,340 --> 00:20:25,600
Maka.

372
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:29,520
This problem can't be solved by saying sorry.

373
00:20:30,300 --> 00:20:32,520
What Krona did was extremely serious.

374
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:35,220
You're a fine one to talk about loyalty.

375
00:20:36,220 --> 00:20:36,500
Huh?

376
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,900
You don't know what loyalty is.

377
00:20:38,980 --> 00:20:40,280
How many promises did you break

378
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:41,280
when you and Mom were together?

379
00:20:41,780 --> 00:20:43,360
How many times did you say sorry

380
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:44,440
only to do it again?

381
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:47,080
Those two situations have nothing in common.

382
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,080
Don't you understand the gravity of this?

383
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:50,420
No, I don't.

384
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:53,200
If you got a second chance, so should he.

385
00:20:54,060 --> 00:20:55,900
I trust him not to do it again.

386
00:20:55,900 --> 00:21:00,520
Lord Death.

387
00:21:00,780 --> 00:21:01,200
Huh?

388
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:03,520
An urgent police report.

389
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:05,960
Someone's been sighted in the city.

390
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:07,900
Someone being...

391
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:10,180
The Snake Woman has come back.

392
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:21,080
It's Medusa.

393
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:21,140
It's Medusa.

394
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:29,680
Why have you come here?

395
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:32,380
I'm not here to fight you.

396
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,160
I surrender.

397
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:35,220
I surrender.

398
00:21:35,220 --> 00:21:35,500
I surrender.

399
00:21:45,500 --> 00:21:46,400
I surrender.

400
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,400
Yeah

401
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:30,420
oh

402
00:22:32,540 --> 00:22:36,540
you

403
00:22:46,400 --> 00:23:10,400
Oh wow, that was a really good episode, wasn't it sis?

404
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:12,400
I guess, if you're sentimental

405
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:15,400
That part at the end was so sweet, it made me cry

406
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:17,400
I suppose it was a little touching

407
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:20,400
It looks like it even made you cry, big sis

408
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:23,400
I'm not crying, I don't know what you're talking about

409
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:26,400
But your face is wet and your eyes are all puffy

410
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:32,400
On the next episode of Soul Eater, the cards are cut, Medusa surrenders to the DWMA

411
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:34,400
I told you, I wasn't crying

